+ *     with a marker, not rejected;
+ *   - E2: an unwritable temp dir throws through to the caller's per-stamp
+ *     warn-and-skip — today's failure mode, unchanged;
+ *   - the single shellQuote helper (AC5 audit) is re-exported from
