+ * `Lockfile smoke (${{ matrix.os }} release)`; /bin/sh (dash) saw `${{ ... }}`
+ * → `Bad substitution`, exit 2, NO stamp written. Missing stamps keep the
+ * required checks "expected" → PRs BLOCKED (bridge-free mode, factory #510).
